OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike and e-scooter fire risks
OL,4,Aexplained
OL,5,
OL,6,FE-bike and e-scooter owners are being
OL,7,Fwarned about the dangers of charging
OL,8,Flithium-ion batteries after Merseyside
OL,9,FFire and Rescue Service (MFRS)
OL,10,Fconfirmed a fire that killed a mother
OL,11,Fand three of her children was caused by
OL,12,Fone.
OL,14,FElisha Brabin, 36, and her children,
OL,15,FLeo, 16, Ellis, eight, and Prudence,
OL,16,Fseven, died after a fire "spread
OL,17,Frapidly" through their home in Stone
OL,18,FSquare, Bootle, in the early hours of
OL,19,F22 September.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
