OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike and e-scooter fire risks
OL,4,Aexplained
OL,5,
OL,6,FMFRS said investigators found an
OL,7,Fe-scooter battery charging at the
OL,8,Fproperty.
OL,10,FKev Johnson, the fire service's head of
OL,11,Fprevention, said the tragedy
OL,12,F"highlights the very real risks posed
OL,13,Fby lithium-ion batteries".
